          reads as one tight header block. The standalone Trust section
          that previously sat below was retired — its premise is
          carried by this prose plus the cadence + orders sections. --}}
    <div class="opening">
      <p><span class="lede">The Stewards are Dialecta&rsquo;s writers</span>, recognized not by appointment but by readers who have come to trust their work over time.</p>
      <p>The Orders below aren&rsquo;t a closed circle. They&rsquo;re a portrait of the kinds of writing this place wants to make possible, and a path for anyone who wants to grow toward them. No committee to impress, no credential to claim, no follower count to accrue. Just the work, the readers who read it, and time.</p>
