      <h2 class="section-title">Cadence: the rhythm of contribution</h2>
      <p class="section-lede">Frequency isn&rsquo;t its own Order. A once-a-year writer and a weekly writer can share an identity at different rhythms. Every Steward&rsquo;s Order is paired with a cadence drawn from publishing: a Magnum Opus Steward publishing four times a year carries the same weight as a Serial Steward publishing weekly. Depth over volume.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="cadence-grid">
      <div class="cadence-card" data-cadence="daily">
        <div class="cadence-name">Daily</div>
